  "description": "TUnit-native JSON assertions for .NET tests. Fluent .Method(...) entry points (generated via TUnit's [GenerateAssertion]) for asserting the presence or absence of a property at a dot-separated JSON path, over a JSON string or a System.Text.Json JsonElement. The 0.0.1 release is an intentionally narrow skeleton that establishes the repository, claims the package identifier, and locks the API style and quality bar; the wider path / value / shape surface ships at 0.1.0. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection.",
